OL,3,AMan charged over Manchester synagogue
OL,4,Aattack
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say the charge "relates
OL,7,Fdirectly" to the attack, which took
OL,8,Fplace on the morning of 2 October last
OL,9,Fyear when two men were killed when the
OL,10,FHeaton Park Hebrew Congregation
OL,11,Fsynagogue was attacked by Jihad
OL,12,FAl-Shamie, who died at the scene after
OL,13,Fbeing shot by police.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
