OL,3,ATrump vows tougher economic measures on
OL,4,AIran and supporting countries
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump has said he will launch
OL,7,Ftougher economic measures against Iran,
OL,8,Fas well as any country that helps or
OL,9,Fdoes business with it.
OL,11,FThe US president wrote in all capital
OL,12,Fletters on Truth Social that he was
OL,13,Flaunching "the most crushing economic
OL,14,Foperation ever taken against any
OL,15,Fcountry", without providing further
OL,16,Fdetails or the names of any nation
OL,17,Fother than Iran.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
