OL,3,ABelgian car salesman becomes prince
OL,4,Aafter royal parentage confirmed
OL,5,
OL,6,FBelgium's Prince Laurent has legally
OL,7,Frecognised 26-year-old former car
OL,8,Fsalesman Clement Vandenkerckhove as his
OL,9,Fson and heir.
OL,11,FVandenkerckhove, the result of a
OL,12,Frelationship between the royal and
OL,13,FBelgian singer Wendy Van Wanten, was
OL,14,Fquietly brought into Prince Laurent's
OL,15,Ffamily at a town hall ceremony six
OL,16,Fmonths ago, although details have only
OL,17,Fjust emerged.
OL,19,FWhile he formally becomes a prince, he
OL,20,Fwill not receive a royal allowance.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
